commit 9d959198a5213d7b1a6e3de9865ecd21c854cdfd
Author: kaigani <kaigani@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 12:46:55 2026 -0800

    fix(vector,oracle): collapsed-contour snap candidates; carry-over bound as documented (C24-R2-06)
    
    The route oracle offers retained anchors of zero-length contours as snap candidates
    (stroke/segment/parameter ties; zero-length edges stay out of faces) and its
    interior-point fallback uses the zone's published interior point. The product's carry
    bound compared twice-areas with twice the length - half the documented bound - and now
    uses four times it. Helper changes mirrored into the reviewer's c24_r2_routes.rs copy
    (declared); property bodies unchanged.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

